  S1 FINITE-EXACT: on [3,60) x^2 obeys the odd law exactly at n = [5, 10, 13, 17, 25, 26, 29, 34, 37, 41, 50, 53, 58] = {n : 4 !| n, every odd prime factor of n is 1 mod 4} (observation only; not proved)
