== S4 bilinear sum, Pillai gcd-sum ==
  S4 S(n) and N3(n) closed forms for 2 <= n <= 260; truth set of (3) = primes; P(n) = prod p^(a-1)((a+1)p-a) [= braids2 (5) + 2n - 1]
  S4 P(n) >= 2n - 1 with equality iff n prime, all 2 <= n <= 5000
  S4 table (P, N3) at n = 4,5,6,7,8,9,12,15 confirmed
  S4b 4N3 - (N1+N2) = 2(P-2n+1) - Z_3 for 2 <= n < 150; witnesses n=6: (Z_3, P-2n+1) = (0,4); n=8: (3,5)
